{"id": "t052-029", "text": "Ana - parents' 40th anniv party Sat 21 November 2026, 7pm, at their house in Croydon. A's doing a slideshow - wants old photos of her + her brother Felix by the 14th. her dad's not been great (heart stuff) so it's a smaller do than planned, family + close friends only. I'm bringing dessert. find the uni photos this wkend + send them over", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "40th anniv party", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sat 21 November 2026, 7pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "house in Croydon", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "A", "pronoun": "she", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Felix", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the 14th", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "heart stuff", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "find the uni photos", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this wkend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send them over", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
